duskMonAlloy -->|udp 53| nightDNS
duskMonAlloy -->|tcp 80,443; 9100| duskTraefik
duskMonAlloy -->|9002| duskGate
duskMonAlloy -->|9002| duskNetCtr

%% night-server-monitor-traefik (RED)
nightMonTraefik -->|udp 53| dayDNS
nightMonTraefik -->|udp 53| nightDNS
nightMonTraefik -->|tcp 80,443| duskTraefik

%% night-server-monitor-alloy (DARK RED)
